OL,3,GNEWSASinger meets his Forest heroes    
OL,4,Aafter public support                   
OL,6,FA popular singer who felt "upset" after
OL,7,Fa police welfare check has met his     
OL,8,FNottingham Forest heroes.              
OL,10,FMiles Green has become a well-known    
OL,11,Ffigure in Carlton, Nottinghamshire,    
OL,12,Fsinging on the corner near the One Stop
OL,13,Fhe works at almost every day.          
OL,15,FLast month, dozens of people gathered  
OL,16,Fto support the 28-year-old, who has    
OL,17,FDown's syndrome, as he felt he would no
OL,18,Flonger be able to perform after the    
OL,19,Fpolice visit.                          
