OL,3,GNEWSASinger meets his Forest heroes    
OL,4,Aafter public support                   
OL,6,FHis friends shared his story with      
OL,7,FNottingham Forest, and the club invited
OL,8,Fhim on Thursday to meet the players and
OL,9,Fwatch them train - an experience       
OL,10,Fmanager Oliver Glasner said gave them  
OL,11,F"a lot of energy".                     
